**Given:**

**{{2 tan 60°} over 1+ tan²60°}**

**Concept used:**

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/57f7fb24770768c366856a149b82fe082557fa92cb98eb20165ba2655303d87f.png] 

**Calculation:**

{{2 tan 60°} over 1+ tan²60°}

⇒ {{2sqrt3} over 1+3}

⇒ {{2sqrt3} over 4}

⇒ {{sqrt3} over 2}

⇒ {{sqrt3} over 2} = sin 60°

**∴ The required answer is sin 60°.**

4d
